#: templates/default/list_networks.html:9 templates/modern/list_networks.html:9
msgid ""
"Each network (CIDR block) maps to exactly one view. Resolvers in that "
"network receive only the zone variants assigned to the mapped view. PowerDNS "
"evaluates networks longest-prefix first, so a more specific subnet (for "
"example 10.0.1.0/24) overrides a broader range (10.0.0.0/8) when both match "
"a client."
msgstr ""
"Mapáiltear gach líonra (bloc CIDR) go dtí aon amharc amháin. Ní fhaigheann "
"réiteoirí sa líonra sin ach na leaganacha den chrios atá sannta don amharc "
"mapáilte. Déanann PowerDNS meastóireacht ar líonraí de réir an réimíre is "
"faide ar dtús, mar sin sáraíonn folíonra níos sainiúla (mar shampla "
"10.0.1.0/24) raon níos leithne (10.0.0.0/8) nuair a mheaitseálann an dá "
"cheann cliant."

