#: templates/default/list_views.html:9 templates/modern/list_views.html:9
msgid ""
"Views serve different zone variants to different clients based on the "
"network that queried the resolver. Each variant is named zone..variant (for "
"example, example.com..trusted) and must exist as a separate zone in PowerDNS "
"before it can be assigned here. Variants share a name but resolve "
"differently per view, so the same hostname can answer with different IPs "
"depending on the client's network."
msgstr ""
"Freastalaíonn amhairc leaganacha éagsúla de chrios ar chliaint éagsúla "
"bunaithe ar an líonra a chuir an cheist chuig an réiteoir. Tá an t-ainm "
"zone..variant ar gach leagan (mar shampla, example.com..trusted) agus ní mór "
"dó a bheith ann mar chrios ar leith i PowerDNS sular féidir é a shannadh "
"anseo. Roinneann na leaganacha ainm ach réitíonn siad go difriúil de réir an "
"amhairc, mar sin is féidir leis an óstainm céanna freagra a thabhairt le "
"IPanna éagsúla ag brath ar líonra an chliaint."

