#: templates/default/api_keys.html:179 templates/modern/api_keys.html:179
msgid ""
"API keys allow external applications to access the Poweradmin API. Each key "
"is linked to your user account and inherits your permissions, so revoking "
"your account also revokes all its keys. Treat keys as secrets - they grant "
"the same access as logging in as you."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann eochracha API do fheidhmchláir sheachtracha rochtain a fháil ar API "
"Poweradmin. Tá gach eochair nasctha le do chuntas úsáideora agus faigheann "
"sí do chuid ceadanna, agus mar sin nuair a chúlghairtear do chuntas "
"cúlghairtear a chuid eochracha go léir freisin. Caith le heochracha mar rúin "
"- tugann siad an rochtain chéanna is a thugann logáil isteach mar tusa."

