msgstr ""
"Is féidir go dtarlódh sé seo le linn athshuiteála má tá srianta saincheaptha "
"agat nó má dhéanann táblaí eile tagairt do na táblaí"

#: install/helpers/InstallStepHandler.php:229
msgid ""
"You can try manually disabling foreign key checks before running the "
"installer:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat triail a bhaint as seiceálacha eochrach coigríche a "
"dhíchumasú de láimh sula ritheann tú an suiteálaí:"

#: install/helpers/InstallStepHandler.php:242
msgid "Suggestions:"
msgstr "Moltaí:"

#: install/helpers/InstallStepHandler.php:236
msgid "Make sure the SQLite database file exists"
msgstr "Bí cinnte go bhfuil comhad bunachair shonraí SQLite ann"

#: install/helpers/InstallStepHandler.php:237
msgid ""
"Check that the web server has read and write permissions for the database "
"file"
msgstr ""
"Seiceáil go bhfuil ceadanna léite agus scríofa ag an bhfreastalaí gréasáin "
"ar chomhad an bhunachair shonraí"

